<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島頭を抱えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, let me sort this out one more time. 
{PAUSE ""}
The shinigami this time is <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>. The shinigami in the past were <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>'s parents. The real target this time is me. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Natsumi's dad</STYLE> got caught in the crossfire. Right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, still holding her head, nodded.</STYLE><PG>
"But there's still a lot I don't get. The shinigami must figure we might go to the police station, right? 
{PAUSE ""}
　But then the shinigami can't lay a hand on us. The plan should end in failure."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's... I'm sorry... I don't know..."</STYLE><PG>
"And then there's the reason for killing me. That <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> would hate me enough to kill me..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That... I don't know either..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, of all people, was throwing up her hands. Had our reasoning hit a dead end here?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, do you know what the shinigami looks like, or anything?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\能面背景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"This is my guess, but a nata and a mace, and it's wearing big red robes. And it should have a Noh mask on."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"A Noh mask? Why a Noh mask, of all things..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Maybe it wanted to dress in something to do with death? 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　</STYLE>Besides, I thought the shinigami was really <STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE>, so a Noh mask and red robes, a nata and a mace―"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"No, um, w-wait a second! Things have gotten all kinds of strange here, haven't they?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Did I say something strange?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, tell me more about the Noh masks and red robes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, what's there to tell... Of course you wear a Noh mask at a memorial service, right? 
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
　And the dead person, as a shinigami, has a Noh mask, red robes, a nata, and a mace. 
{PAUSE ""}
Following that, the people at the funeral dress the same as the dead person."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh...?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't really get it, but that outfit is something really important in this case. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I've never heard of a custom of wearing Noh masks at memorial services!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Come to think of it, I'd never been to anyone else's memorial service. Were the Niimura family's services special?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"When you say shinigami, the usual image is a skeleton with a big scythe. A Noh mask and red robes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, I know that much. But <STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE>'s family home is in the <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="あらたしゅうらく">Arata settlement</STYLE>, and there a shinigami is a Noh mask and red robes. 
{PAUSE ""}
In the settlement, they call the dead person a shinigami, and the people at the memorial service dress the same as the shinigami. 
{PAUSE ""}
Sometimes on TV I see these lazy-looking funerals where people just wear suits, but if you do it properly, it's gotta be a Noh mask and red robes, right?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"So, </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">, at your family's place, everyone at a memorial, the attendees and the dead person alike, wears a Noh mask and red robes?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, that's right. You end up with a whole row of Noh masks."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ふ">It</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> all clicks now... At last I can see the right angle..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> gathered up the pen and notepad she'd tossed aside.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, this case may have much deeper roots. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I thought </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">your mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was the ringleader, but something felt a little off to me. How could she have pulled it off so smoothly? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Tell me all about the Niimura family!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Uh... 'all about' it? I don't know that much either."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\荒田集落イメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"It's called the <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="あらたしゅうらく">Arata settlement</STYLE>, a remote backwater where <STYLE ID="9">Dad</STYLE>'s family home is. 
{PAUSE ""}
It's in the northwest of Iizawa Prefecture, and only about 30 people live there. Beyond that..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">I'd never lived in the </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="あらたしゅうらく">Arata settlement</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, and I only went back now and then with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">.</STYLE><PG>
"No... come to think of it, when <STYLE ID="2">my mom</STYLE> goes back to the settlement, she gets a surprisingly warm welcome. 
{PAUSE ""}
Apparently the ancestors were a bunch of outcasts to begin with, so women who marry into the <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="あらたしゅうらく">Arata settlement</STYLE> are really appreciated, or so I hear."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> kept taking notes without a word.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"This is just my own assumption, but I feel like settlements like that are really closed to outsiders. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But if brides who marry in get welcomed, it must be a really big-hearted settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Aren't there any unusual conditions for marrying in, or anything?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">The settlement itself was insular and didn't try to have much to do with anyone else.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">So marrying in might have been a hard thing, but I'd never heard any stories like that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> probably wouldn't talk about hardships like that anyway, being who she is.</STYLE><PG>
"Sorry, I don't know of any conditions for marrying in. Maybe there's something, but as far as I..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">True, there was the Noh mask thing―and for something </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> did, it went too smoothly, like </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> said. That bothered me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Which means, as a possibility―</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, could people from the Arata settlement be helping out?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">If so, stopping a crime this big would be impossible...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't think they're directly involved. Otherwise, there'd be no reason </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had to be killed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s parents could become this time's victims because they did the killing in the Megasawa City case. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If people from the Arata settlement had done the killing in the Megasawa City case, there'd be no need to go out of the way to use the Kogori family, and the Kogoris would have nothing at all to do with the Megasawa City case."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">That was true. If the crimes in the Megasawa City case were done by people from the Arata settlement, the Kogori family had nothing to do with them, or with today's case either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">For one thing, everyone in the settlement had attended the memorial services so far, so going to Megasawa on April 8 would have been impossible.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">In an insular settlement like that, missing a wedding or a funeral hardly ever―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">No, hold on...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">In that case, there was no way </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> would be allowed to skip the memorial service today because of work.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">And it was the memorial for </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">her own husband</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, at that.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Me being sick, like this time, was one thing, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> being allowed to miss it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">So if the Arata settlement also knew that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> was going to commit some kind of crime today...</STYLE><PG>
"So people from the Arata settlement are helping indirectly, is that it? 
{PAUSE ""}
Even if they aren't directly involved, I think they'd probably cooperate somehow if <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> asked them to."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島頭を抱えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I thought so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> set down her pen and held her head in her hands.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">No wonder. This had gotten way too big.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry, let me take a little break..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, sorry for putting you through all this."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">If we were up against the whole settlement, even </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> would have no way to deal with it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">The least I could do was remember anything I could about the settlement and come up with a plan...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\荒田集落イメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10" RUBY="あらたしゅうらく">The Arata settlement</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">It has about 30 people, and you only reach it by going even deeper into the mountains from the last station on the line, already far back in the hills.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">This being the modern day, there are cars and electricity, but no convenience stores or supermarkets, and a lot of the food comes from hunting and farming.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">People do go down to the foot of the mountain to shop sometimes, though.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">But it's true: outside the </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="あらたしゅうらく">Arata settlement</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, I've never seen the shinigami outfit.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">I've seen it ever since I can remember, so it doesn't feel strange to me, though.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Well, the settlement's culture doesn't matter right now.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> thought the chance of the settlement being involved in the Megasawa City case was slim.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Because then there'd be no need for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s parents to do the killing, and they wouldn't have become victims in this case either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">If anything was possible, it was that the settlement was involved in this case.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Say that for some reason, to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s parents, today </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> made her move.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">If the settlement was moving to help </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> with that―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> got down on her knees and begged, the settlement might well move.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">That's how welcome a bride from outside is.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Damn... I want to reject the theory that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s the culprit, but no matter what, everything just makes sense.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">But if 30 people were on the move...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Hm? So that means... people from the settlement... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="5">are here in Motoki-cho?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\椅子から立つ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Before I knew it, I'd stood up and was looking all around.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, what's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, don't you get it!? People from the <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="あらたしゅうらく">Arata settlement</STYLE> could be all around us!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Even here in Zahha, somewhere, secretly watching us...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Where!? Where are they!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10" RUBY="あらたしゅうらく">Arata settlement</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> faces, I know every last one! Where the heck are they!?</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="5">............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But there was no one who looked like that.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I think that's fine. In a small settlement, you'd know their faces, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Even if it's possible, it'd only be indirect help."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, that's right..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Besides, didn't I say this case was unexpected for the culprit too? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Suddenly moving a big group down from the north of Iizawa Prefecture would stand out, for sure. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And if a big group showed up on the day something like this happened, even the police would keep a sharp eye out."</STYLE><PG>
"That's true. But there are a lot of tourists right now, right? A big crowd coming without knowing about the case wouldn't look unnatural, would it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's... true. I can't completely rule it out after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Come to think of it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s taking a while, isn't she?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Hey...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">That means!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
